# `lab/` — Wet-lab protocols & records

The human/bench side of the project: protocols, reagent and sample notes, and the
link to the electronic lab notebook (ELN). This connects physical experiments to
the `metadata/` manifests that name the resulting data files.

## What belongs here
- Protocols and SOPs (versioned as text/PDF).
- Notes that give context to samples — but the machine-readable
  `sample_id → condition → file` mapping lives in [`../metadata/`](../metadata/),
  validated.

## Rules
- **People maintain this folder.** Automated agents do **not** fabricate sample
  manifests, protocol steps, or measurements here — that would invent provenance.
- Prefer the ELN as system of record; keep this folder as the repo-side reference
  and pointer to it.
